    {
      "id": "rcx1GkgZoThiHbur8dwvn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -215,
      "y": -10.5,
      "width": 423.97967529296875,
      "height": 425,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b06",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 411468764,
      "version": 71,
      "versionNonce": 1659113180,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783615384298,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Extra clarification (good if you are staff)\n* Is this for desktop, mobile, or both?\n* Do we need infinite scroll?\n* Do cards have fixed image aspect \nratios from the backend?\n* Do we need ads or promoted \npins inserted?\n* Do we need server-side rendering \nfor SEO?\n* Do we need accessibility and \nkeyboard navigation?\n* What is the target scale? \nThousands of pins? \nMillions in backend, \nbut frontend renders a subset.\n* Do we need real-time updates, \nor is feed mostly append-only while scrolling",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Extra clarification (good if you are staff)\n* Is this for desktop, mobile, or both?\n* Do we need infinite scroll?\n* Do cards have fixed image aspect \nratios from the backend?\n* Do we need ads or promoted \npins inserted?\n* Do we need server-side rendering \nfor SEO?\n* Do we need accessibility and \nkeyboard navigation?\n* What is the target scale? \nThousands of pins? \nMillions in backend, \nbut frontend renders a subset.\n* Do we need real-time updates, \nor is feed mostly append-only while scrolling",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "8tBPnHYurfRKFBI315pF-",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 296.765625,
      "y": 149.40625,
      "width": 636.1795654296875,
      "height": 400,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b07",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1594926692,
      "version": 346,
      "versionNonce": 701700964,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783615453017,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Responsive masonry layout.\n2. Variable-height cards.\n3. Infinite scrolling.\n4. Search or category-driven feed loading.\n5. Image lazy loading.\n6. Card interactions:\n    * Open pin detail.\n    * Save/unsave.\n    * Hide/report.\n7. Responsive column count:\n    * Mobile: 2 columns.\n    * Tablet: 3 columns.\n    * Desktop: 4–6 columns.\n8. Preserve scroll position when navigating back from detail page.\n9. Handle loading, empty, and error states.\n10. Support accessibility.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Responsive masonry layout.\n2. Variable-height cards.\n3. Infinite scrolling.\n4. Search or category-driven feed loading.\n5. Image lazy loading.\n6. Card interactions:\n    * Open pin detail.\n    * Save/unsave.\n    * Hide/report.\n7. Responsive column count:\n    * Mobile: 2 columns.\n    * Tablet: 3 columns.\n    * Desktop: 4–6 columns.\n8. Preserve scroll position when navigating back from detail page.\n9. Handle loading, empty, and error states.\n10. Support accessibility.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "v9bg0fgv5cL_mW6gUx27f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 306,
      "y": 618.5,
      "width": 263.59979248046875,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b08",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1644861404,
      "version": 46,
      "versionNonce": 658416220,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783615482728,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Non-functional Requirement",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non-functional Requirement",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "7vC4mt-fcuG8LF9uaCrtq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 306,
      "y": 640.5,
      "width": 500.399658203125,
      "height": 525,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b09",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 8227812,
      "version": 12,
      "versionNonce": 1588248420,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783615517532,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Performance\n* Smooth scrolling, ideally 60 FPS.\n* Avoid layout thrashing.\n* Avoid rendering thousands of DOM nodes.\n* Avoid cumulative layout shift.\n* Optimize images.\nReliability\n* Retry failed feed requests.\n* Gracefully handle broken images.\n* Deduplicate pins across pages.\n* Prevent infinite scroll double-fetching.\nUX\n* Skeleton loading.\n* Stable layout while images load.\n* Smooth responsive resizing.\n* Preserve scroll on navigation.\nAccessibility\n* Keyboard navigation.\n* Proper image alt text.\n* Buttons have labels.\n* Avoid trapping keyboard users in infinite content.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Performance\n* Smooth scrolling, ideally 60 FPS.\n* Avoid layout thrashing.\n* Avoid rendering thousands of DOM nodes.\n* Avoid cumulative layout shift.\n* Optimize images.\nReliability\n* Retry failed feed requests.\n* Gracefully handle broken images.\n* Deduplicate pins across pages.\n* Prevent infinite scroll double-fetching.\nUX\n* Skeleton loading.\n* Stable layout while images load.\n* Smooth responsive resizing.\n* Preserve scroll on navigation.\nAccessibility\n* Keyboard navigation.\n* Proper image alt text.\n* Buttons have labels.\n* Avoid trapping keyboard users in infinite content.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "oPLK3dfdIl4YP81DWDXI0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 295,
      "y": 1245.5,
      "width": 532.599609375,
      "height": 525,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0A",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 960477668,
      "version": 20,
      "versionNonce": 1153414884,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783615580290,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "API\nGET /api/feed?cursor=abc&limit=30&topic=home-decor\n\nResponse:\n{\n  items: Pin[],\n  nextCursor: string | null\n}\n\ntype Pin = {\n  id: string;\n  title: string;\n  imageUrl: string;\n  imageWidth: number;\n  imageHeight: number;\n  dominantColor?: string;\n  creatorName?: string;\n  saved?: boolean;\n};\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "API\nGET /api/feed?cursor=abc&limit=30&topic=home-decor\n\nResponse:\n{\n  items: Pin[],\n  nextCursor: string | null\n}\n\ntype Pin = {\n  id: string;\n  title: string;\n  imageUrl: string;\n  imageWidth: number;\n  imageHeight: number;\n  dominantColor?: string;\n  creatorName?: string;\n  saved?: boolean;\n};\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "PWwoXKvm6wsUiwIyevguQ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1227.166361426981,
      "y": 285.3654259522484,
      "width": 530.2879858099769,
      "height": 649.2599697825136,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0B",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 13074148,
      "version": 274,
      "versionNonce": 677921892,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783615892851,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Client\n ├── FeedPage\n │    ├── Search / Topic Header\n │    ├── MasonryFeed\n │    │    ├── MasonryLayoutEngine\n │    │    ├── VirtualizedColumns\n │    │    ├── PinCard\n │    │    └── InfiniteScrollSentinel\n │    └── FeedStateProvider\n │\n ├── Feed API Client\n │    ├── fetchPins(cursor, filters)\n │    ├── savePin(pinId)\n │    └── reportPin(pinId)\n │\n └── Browser APIs\n      ├── IntersectionObserver\n      ├── ResizeObserver\n      └── Image loading / decoding",
      "fontSize": 27.33726188557951,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Client\n ├── FeedPage\n │    ├── Search / Topic Header\n │    ├── MasonryFeed\n │    │    ├── MasonryLayoutEngine\n │    │    ├── VirtualizedColumns\n │    │    ├── PinCard\n │    │    └── InfiniteScrollSentinel\n │    └── FeedStateProvider\n │\n ├── Feed API Client\n │    ├── fetchPins(cursor, filters)\n │    ├── savePin(pinId)\n │    └── reportPin(pinId)\n │\n └── Browser APIs\n      ├── IntersectionObserver\n      ├── ResizeObserver\n      └── Image loading / decoding",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
