      "seed": 1112366300,
      "version": 918,
      "versionNonce": 1434339548,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783616477153,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Topic we should discuss for deepdive interview\n1. Feed Loading (pagination, infinite scrolling, additional data need to be fetched for Pin)\n2. Media loading (image attribute, format, sizing, CDN)\n3. Layout & rendering (Mansory Layout)\n4. Paint schedule (controlling image paint order to make dense visual feed more stable)\n5. Performance (virtualization, layout work, DOM size)\n6. Network (request limit, concurrent media download, network pressure on image-heavy pages)\n7. User experience (placeholder on load, hover/preview action)\n8. i18n: rtl layout, localization\n9. a11y: alt text, semantic structure, keyboard navigation",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Topic we should discuss for deepdive interview\n1. Feed Loading (pagination, infinite scrolling, additional data need to be fetched for Pin)\n2. Media loading (image attribute, format, sizing, CDN)\n3. Layout & rendering (Mansory Layout)\n4. Paint schedule (controlling image paint order to make dense visual feed more stable)\n5. Performance (virtualization, layout work, DOM size)\n6. Network (request limit, concurrent media download, network pressure on image-heavy pages)\n7. User experience (placeholder on load, hover/preview action)\n8. i18n: rtl layout, localization\n9. a11y: alt text, semantic structure, keyboard navigation",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
