      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783617773105,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "-- Flex and grid cannot express this layout without breaking reading order, so pins are positioned via transform inside a fixed-width container. \n-- pins can be emitted into the DOM in feed order so tab order and screen reader order match what sighted users see, while a running columnHeights array decides which shortest column each pin drops into.\nAlgorithm:\n1. Determine number of columns from container width.\n2. Track current height of each column.\n3. For each pin:\n    * Estimate rendered height using image aspect ratio.\n    * Place the pin in the shortest column.\n    * Update that column height.\n4. Render columns independently. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-- Flex and grid cannot express this layout without breaking reading order, so pins are positioned via transform inside a fixed-width container. \n-- pins can be emitted into the DOM in feed order so tab order and screen reader order match what sighted users see, while a running columnHeights array decides which shortest column each pin drops into.\nAlgorithm:\n1. Determine number of columns from container width.\n2. Track current height of each column.\n3. For each pin:\n    * Estimate rendered height using image aspect ratio.\n    * Place the pin in the shortest column.\n    * Update that column height.\n4. Render columns independently. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
