      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "*** Accessibility ***",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "*** Accessibility ***",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "xtFE3p1AxBMbz7EI5e-vm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1945.9382915648953,
      "y": 3594.115695754887,
      "width": 670.4691162109375,
      "height": 147.34623080068945,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0y",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1752315108,
      "version": 128,
      "versionNonce": 1251471204,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783618954690,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Accessibility (a11y)\nAn image-first feed relies on text alternatives and predictable semantics so screen reader and \nkeyboard users can browse as easily as sighted mouse users.\n\nScreen readers\n-- alt attribute for <img>s.\n-- role=\"list\" attribute for feed container.\n-- role=\"listitem\" attribute for feed items.\n\nKeyboard support\nEnsure tabbing order matches browsing order, which can be done with absolutely positioned pins.\nWhen the user is far down on the page, pressing Tab should focus on a pin within the viewport rather than the pin at the top of the feed.",
      "fontSize": 9.823082053379299,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Accessibility (a11y)\nAn image-first feed relies on text alternatives and predictable semantics so screen reader and \nkeyboard users can browse as easily as sighted mouse users.\n\nScreen readers\n-- alt attribute for <img>s.\n-- role=\"list\" attribute for feed container.\n-- role=\"listitem\" attribute for feed items.\n\nKeyboard support\nEnsure tabbing order matches browsing order, which can be done with absolutely positioned pins.\nWhen the user is far down on the page, pressing Tab should focus on a pin within the viewport rather than the pin at the top of the feed.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
